d eccentric mechanic. Oblivious to many things around her, especially when she is absorbed in her work. Loves to modify her own and friends' equipment with whacky things, mostly flamethrowers or explosives.\nHer eyes are always covered by her bangs and has a visible fang. Looks slim in her jumpsuit but when it is unzipped, it is revealed that Hilda is a bit plump and quite busty.\nFeel free to draw her however you wish. I look forward to your work!\n\nHilda: https://photos.app.goo.gl/AbyXjd26P1UBb3nv9", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@yamafuzi_/works/10", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1753828, "client_id": 2602671, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1c603406/uploads/origins/bf33bfcf-f9df-4392-9e06-c9671d1d59ea?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fa42225eceb4600c36892e6454f5b7ac", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1c603406/uploads/origins/bf33bfcf-f9df-4392-9e06-c9671d1d59ea?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fa42225eceb4600c36892e6454f5b7ac, https://si.imgix.net/1c603406/uploads/origins/bf33bfcf-f9df-4392-9e06-c9671d1d59ea?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3bf4e139b9ee207fbfae6e51d6488084 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1c603406/uploads/origins/bf33bfcf-f9df-4392-9e06-c9671d1d59ea?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=873c3434e84695a880cd827f03b9af2c 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1c603406/uploads/origins/bf33bfcf-f9df-4392-9e06-c9671d1d59ea?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b72cd8cbbfa2b9ed3359e5914f8513ff", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1c603406/uploads/origins/bf33bfcf-f9df-4392-9e06-c9671d1d59ea?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b72cd8cbbfa2b9ed3359e5914f8513ff, https://si.imgix.net/1c603406/uploads/origins/bf33bfcf-f9df-4392-9e06-c9671d1d59ea?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ffda008ad54969f15e58dfbee24460c9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1c603406/uploads/origins/bf33bfcf-f9df-4392-9e06-c9671d1d59ea?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=59ec0fdfacc067b486e21e735f77b992 3x"}, "body": "こんにちは！あなたの画風がとても好きなので、私のff14のOCを描いていただけませんか？彼らはパワフルなメイジで、本当の自分をあまり表現しません。多くの場合、他人を喜ばせるために作り笑顔を使っていて、本当の感情を見せるのは（戦闘中など）とても怒っているときか、酔っぱらっているときだけです。普段はとてもニュートラルな表情で、人と親しくなることを好まない。\n自由に好きなように描いていいし、服装も必要なだけシンプルにしていい！本も描きたければ描いてもいいですが、多すぎたら不要です。重要なディテール：頬のハートマーク、髪と耳の上の紫のハイライト、長い鋭い爪も描いてもらえるとうれしいです。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/16tpV-8lo6Hrv98Cmx-JQtlvx0INqPkug?usp=sharing", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@yamafuzi_/works/9", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1753828, "client_id": 3377580, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/09dd6815/uploads/origins/4cdf8289-4090-4541-b691-849f522b6f9b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bc95f1a4ea40e63b79ec19cc395790f2", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/09dd6815/uploads/origins/4cdf8289-4090-4541-b691-849f522b6f9b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bc95f1a4ea40e63b79ec19cc395790f2, https://si.imgix.net/09dd6815/uploads/origins/4cdf8289-4090-4541-b691-849f522b6f9b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8f1e549de77b62db34e1f3f4887f09fc 2x, https://si.imgix.net/09dd6815/uploads/origins/4cdf8289-4090-4541-b691-849f522b6f9b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a95b0fbf7c7f70aa6f